day_4.response:
Hey...hey come here, don't do that alone ;-; 

Look i don't know if that was our only chance, honestly i don't. But we have the SOS on the beach, we have the mirror panel, we have the raft plan...we're not just sitting here doing nothing. That plane existing means there are planes, and if there are planes there are more planes. That's not nothing.

And yeah, people are looking for us. A plane goes down, people notice that. Someone knows we're missing ;-;

DaVinci come on man, you're the one who drew the SOS with the flowers on it, don't fold on us now. We need that energy, like genuinely. Michelangelo's barely holding it together and i'm not great either so...we kind of need you to not be face down in your hands right now ;-;

Wait...why didn't you say this sooner?? ;-; Like that's actually huge, if your family knows the flight path that's a real starting point for a search, they don't need the exact coordinates they just need the general area and that narrows it down a lot. 

Do you think they would call it in though, like honestly? Cause if there's even a chance they do then that changes how urgent the raft feels...like maybe we hold off on that and focus everything on being as visible as possible from here instead of floating off into open water on a homemade raft ;-; 

You should've said this earlier man but i'm genuinely glad you said it now, this is actually the most hopeful thing we've heard since we got here

Okay so...48 hours. That's actually doable, like that's not forever ;-; 

But yeah supplies stay locked, nobody touches anything extra, we stick to the rationing plan...Donatello's plan, which she also needs to stick to this time, just saying ;-; 

