Also...can someone feed the fire please. I know we're all tired and that was a heavy moment but the fire going out right now would be really bad

Yeah...yeah i'm scared too, i won't pretend i'm not ;-;

But that thing you said, about disappearing without leaving anything behind...i think about that more than i'd admit normally. Like you stopped piano and you still think about it, i never started anything and i think about that too. 

I don't know if this counts for anything but...you're not disappearing right now. Like you're the one who spotted that plane, you're the one who told us about your family knowing the flight path, which by the way might actually be the thing that gets us rescued. You said the thing nobody else would say out loud every single time. That's not nothing, that's actually kind of a lot ;-;

I think the leaving something behind stuff...maybe it doesn't have to be big. Maybe it's just that the people around you actually felt like someone was paying attention to them. You do that. I've noticed that.

Anyway. Who's taking first sky watch cause i'll do it if nobody else wants it, i'm not gonna sleep for a while anyway ;-;

